7d4","comments":[{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Implementation complete in worktree tok-b3 (commit a06c13ce2, Change-Id Iad49af4b). Design: routing entry key \"web\": true on T1; descriptor passthrough in criteria/model.py; pass1_chunk threads RunRequest.web for AGENT chunks; runner attaches Anthropic server-side web_search via pydantic-ai capabilities (Agent(capabilities=[WebSearch()])), anthropic-gated beside the cache-settings seam. Non-anthropic/unflagged requests byte-identical (unit-tested). T1 rubric updated for conditional availability + fallback. 9 new tests green; lint+typecheck green; full unit suite running. Holding push until Gerrit change 1041 (also edits criteria_routing.json) merges, then rebasing.","timestamp":1785431046558063001}],"created_at":1785384342781915001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"2149e958-251b-49f8-b69d-35188694bd6b","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"b295-2c0b-b7bb-4a12"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nplan_review_T1.md instructs \"Tool-grounded where possible (web/codebase)\", but the agent toolset (src/rebar/llm/pai_tools.py, wired at src/rebar/llm/runner.py:257) provides only read_file, list_directory, search_files, resolve_symbol, show_ticket — no web access. Empirically only 3/14 recent T1 findings were tool-grounded; the rubric's primary grounding channel is dead weight. Operator ruled this a bug.\n\n## Approach\nEnable Anthropic's server-side web-search tool for AGENT criteria that declare it: add an optional `\"web\": true` key to a criterion's routing entry (T1 only, initially); when set and the resolved provider is anthropic, the runner adds the server-side web_search tool to that request's model settings (seam: src/rebar/llm/anthropic_model.py settings assembly, alongside the existing cache settings at anthropic_model.py:39-52). Non-anthropic providers and offline runs get today's behavior; the T1 rubric is updated to say web grounding applies when the tool is offered and to fall back to codebase/plan reasoning otherwise. Alternative rejected: a homegrown HTTP fetch tool in pai_tools — network policy, sanitization, and result-quality burdens for one criterion when the provider offers a managed tool.\n\n## Scope\nsrc/rebar/llm/anthropic_model.py, src/rebar/llm/runner.py (thread the per-request web flag), src/rebar/llm/plan_review/criteria_routing.json (T1 entry), src/rebar/llm/reviewers/plan_review_T1.md, tests/llm/test_web_tool_gating.py.\n\n## Testing\nUnit: a request flagged web=true on an anthropic-resolved model carries the web tool in settings; openai/gemini-resolved models do not; unflagged criteria never carry it. No live web call in tests.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] A T1 pass-1 request against an anthropic-resolved model includes the server-side web-search tool in its model settings (checked: unit test on settings assembly).\n- [ ] Non-anthropic providers and non-web criteria produce byte-identical settings to today (checked: unit test comparison).\n- [ ] plan_review_T1.md describes the conditional availability and the fallback (checked: test asserts rubric text).","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/llm/anthropic_model.py","reason":"server-side web tool settings"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/runner.py","reason":"per-request web flag"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/plan_review/criteria_routing.json","reason":"T1 web annotation"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/reviewers/plan_review_T1.md","reason":"rubric availability note"},{"path":"tests/llm/test_web_tool_gating.py","reason":"new tests"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[["parent","a492-3e46-ca44-40a5"],["relates_to","b295-2c0b-b7bb-4a12"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"a492-3e46-ca44-40a5","parent_status_uuid":"b1ca87e6-6b25-45bc-ae1f-62a060071baf","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"ff64-ca12-7132-40e7","ticket_type":"bug","title":"T1 prior-art rubric mandates web grounding but no web tool exists","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["23e06a8e-d2ea-4c63-bc17-442632f1b8b3","f4fc0422-6586-4748-aebe-31e26ff13c48","b1ca87e6-6b25-45bc-ae1f-62a060071baf","b6040f51-6f17-4a59-887e-54243dcab175","58b9b372-783d-444d-9dab-ece0d1f1aa77","857dea40-d358-42ad-b94f-38f8e45f1acc","2149e958-251b-49f8-b69d-35188694bd6b"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1785439382724166599,"uuid":"fc673148-c091-41e5-8f98-1c0f4a80700e"}